<InfoPage path="/app-download/" label="App download safety" heading="Yarrwin App Download Safety Guide" title="Yarrwin App Download Guide | Avoid Fake APKs" description="How to check a Yarrwin app download safely and avoid fake APK files, malware and phishing pages." >
  <h2>Use a known source</h2><p>Download an app only from a store or download page you can verify through the platform account. Search results and social posts can point to copies. Check the publisher, permissions, spelling and update history before installing anything.</p>
  <h2>Do not trust modified APKs</h2><p>A file promising a hack, unlimited balance, prediction tool or guaranteed win is a warning sign. Unknown APKs can capture passwords, read messages or install unwanted software. This guide does not provide APK files or claim that a particular version is genuine.</p>
  <h2>After installation</h2><p>Keep your phone updated, use a screen lock and remove apps you no longer need. If the platform has a web login, compare the app’s destination with the address you already verified. Report suspicious files to the relevant store or platform support team.</p>
